<|6.72|> You will say that a woman has no need of such a caution. There can be no peril in it for her.<|12.80|>

3
00:00:12,799 --> 00:00:21,920
<|12.80|> The more she is engaged in her proper duties, the less leisure will she have for it, even as an accomplishment and a recreation.<|21.92|>

4
